# This folder is the website root: GitHub Pages publishes it as-is, so anything
# committed here is downloadable by anyone. Secrets must live OUTSIDE this
# folder (see START-HERE.txt step 3); these rules are the backstop if one is
# ever copied in by mistake.
#
# Note: .gitignore only applies when the site is published through git. It does
# not stop a manual upload of the folder — keep secrets out of it entirely.

# Google Cloud service-account keys
service-account*.json
*service-account*.json
google-services.json

# Environment files (SMTP passwords, admin bootstrap password, key paths)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Private keys and certificates
*.pem
*.p12
*.key

# Android / Play signing keys (twa-manifest.json points at ./android.keystore)
*.keystore
*.jks
